    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Inspection Mechanics</strong>: Use tools like UV flashlights, thermometers, and manual scanners to uncover signs of infection or contraband in people and their belongings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/b75b8b0b6c599edd428edce9372bcd54.poster.avif?t=1754990977\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/b75b8b0b6c599edd428edce9372bcd54.webm?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/b75b8b0b6c599edd428edce9372bcd54.mp4?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Balance limited supplies of test kits and inspection tools while maintaining order and ensuring your checkpoint remains secure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/a9dac14b18c2f3c10082e6ccc4233709.poster.avif?t=1754990977\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/a9dac14b18c2f3c10082e6ccc4233709.webm?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/a9dac14b18c2f3c10082e6ccc4233709.mp4?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Threats</strong>: Face an evolving queue of refugees\u2014some healthy, some carrying ordinary illnesses, and others harboring deadly zombie pathogens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/968baec5bc59cd6315f3cfce8eb51071.poster.avif?t=1754990977\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/968baec5bc59cd6315f3cfce8eb51071.webm?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/968baec5bc59cd6315f3cfce8eb51071.mp4?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Decision-Making</strong>: Choose whether to admit, quarantine, or liquidate individuals based on visual clues, document verification, and medical tests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/df31adfa1e690d0372eec87d4b48df65.poster.avif?t=1754990977\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/df31adfa1e690d0372eec87d4b48df65.webm?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/df31adfa1e690d0372eec87d4b48df65.mp4?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Progression</strong>: Manage daily routines, from morning base reports to nighttime defenses, as the stakes rise with each passing day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better dead than sorry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every survivor who crosses your checkpoint wants in\u2014but not all are free of infection. Use military-grade technology, sharp intuition, and strategic judgment to separate the healthy from the infected. Each mistake you make could mean disaster for the evacuation efforts you've been sent to oversee.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world\u2019s survival depends on your ability to hold the line. How long can you keep the outbreak at bay? Make a wise choice!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Inspection Mechanics</strong>: Use tools like UV flashlights, thermometers, and manual scanners to uncover signs of infection or contraband in people and their belongings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/b75b8b0b6c599edd428edce9372bcd54.poster.avif?t=1754990977\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/b75b8b0b6c599edd428edce9372bcd54.webm?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/b75b8b0b6c599edd428edce9372bcd54.mp4?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Balance limited supplies of test kits and inspection tools while maintaining order and ensuring your checkpoint remains secure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/a9dac14b18c2f3c10082e6ccc4233709.poster.avif?t=1754990977\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/a9dac14b18c2f3c10082e6ccc4233709.webm?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/a9dac14b18c2f3c10082e6ccc4233709.mp4?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Threats</strong>: Face an evolving queue of refugees\u2014some healthy, some carrying ordinary illnesses, and others harboring deadly zombie pathogens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/968baec5bc59cd6315f3cfce8eb51071.poster.avif?t=1754990977\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/968baec5bc59cd6315f3cfce8eb51071.webm?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/968baec5bc59cd6315f3cfce8eb51071.mp4?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Decision-Making</strong>: Choose whether to admit, quarantine, or liquidate individuals based on visual clues, document verification, and medical tests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/df31adfa1e690d0372eec87d4b48df65.poster.avif?t=1754990977\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/df31adfa1e690d0372eec87d4b48df65.webm?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419520/extras/df31adfa1e690d0372eec87d4b48df65.mp4?t=1754990977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Progression</strong>: Manage daily routines, from morning base reports to nighttime defenses, as the stakes rise with each passing day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Better dead than sorry</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every survivor who crosses your checkpoint wants in\u2014but not all are free of infection. Use military-grade technology, sharp intuition, and strategic judgment to separate the healthy from the infected. Each mistake you make could mean disaster for the evacuation efforts you've been sent to oversee.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world\u2019s survival depends on your ability to hold the line. How long can you keep the outbreak at bay? Make a wise choice!</p>",
